 "story": {
  "Bear": "AI capex digestion in 2027-28 coincides with tighter China export controls (DUV immersion and servicing). Customers push out EUV orders, the down-payment float shrinks and margins compress as fixed R&D is held.",
  "Base": "2026 guidance is delivered, the backlog converts, and EUV/High-NA adoption in logic and DRAM lift revenue to about EUR 64bn by 2030 (88 low-NA and 22 High-NA EUV systems) with margins at the 2030 target band.",
  "Bull": "A sustained AI-driven leading-edge build-out plus faster High-NA adoption push EUV shipments to 110 low-NA and 32 High-NA systems and revenue to about EUR 81bn, with gross margin at 60% and services scaling on the installed base."
 },
